    "Allow others to copy, distribute, display and perform only verbatim copies of your work, not derivative works based upon it. This option is incompatible with \"Share Alike\".": "Ba\u015fqalar\u0131na sizin \u0259s\u0259ri yaln\u0131z oldu\u011fu kimi g\u00f6st\u0259rm\u0259k, payla\u015fmaq, kopyalayamaq icaz\u0259si verilir. \u018fs\u0259rinizd\u0259n t\u00f6r\u0259m\u0259 i\u015fl\u0259r\u0259 bu icaz\u0259 verilmir. Bu se\u00e7im \"B\u0259rab\u0259rh\u00fcquqlu\" se\u00e7iml\u0259 uy\u011fun deyil.",
    "Allow others to copy, distribute, display and perform your copyrighted work but only if they give credit the way you request. Currently, this option is required.": "Ba\u015fqalar\u0131na sizin \u0259s\u0259ri kopyalaya, payla\u015fa v\u0259 g\u00f6st\u0259r\u0259 bil\u0259r, o \u015f\u0259rtl\u0259 ki, sizin t\u0259l\u0259b etdiyiniz \u015f\u0259kild\u0259 siz\u0259 istinad etsin. Haz\u0131rda bu se\u00e7im t\u0259l\u0259b edilir.",
    "Allow others to copy, distribute, display and perform your work - and derivative works based upon it - but for noncommercial purposes only.": "Ba\u015fqalar\u0131na sizin \u0259s\u0259ri v\u0259 t\u00f6r\u0259m\u0259 \u0259s\u0259rl\u0259ri yaln\u0131z qeyri-kommersiya m\u0259qs\u0259di il\u0259 kopyalaya, payla\u015fa v\u0259 g\u00f6st\u0259r\u0259 bil\u0259r.",
    "Allow others to distribute derivative works only under a license identical to the license that governs your work. This option is incompatible with \"No Derivatives\".": "Ba\u015fqalar\u0131na t\u00f6r\u0259m\u0259 \u0259s\u0259rl\u0259ri yaln\u0131z sizin \u0259s\u0259rl\u0259 eyni lisenziya \u015f\u0259rtl\u0259rind\u0259 payla\u015fa bil\u0259r. Bu se\u00e7im \"T\u00f6r\u0259m\u0259l\u0259r yoxdur\" tipli lisenziya il\u0259 uy\u011funsuzluq t\u0259\u015fkil edir.",
