    "Anchor": "Diktor",
    "Anchors": "Diktorlar",
    "Any content that has listed this content as a prerequisite will also have access limitations removed.": "Haz\u0131rki m\u0259zmunu \u00f6n \u015f\u0259rt olaraq g\u00f6st\u0259r\u0259n h\u0259r hans\u0131 ba\u015fqa m\u0259zmun \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn d\u0259 giri\u015f limitl\u0259ri aradan qalxacaqd\u0131r.",
    "Any course progress or grades from your current session will be lost.": "Sizin m\u00f6vcud sessiyan\u0131zdan kurs \u00fczr\u0259 inki\u015faf v\u0259 qiym\u0259tl\u0259r silin\u0259c\u0259k.",
