    "Any divided discussion topics are divided based on enrollment track.": "H\u0259r hans\u0131 b\u00f6l\u00fcnm\u00fc\u015f m\u00fczakir\u0259 m\u00f6vzusu qeydiyyat yoluna \u0259sas\u0259n b\u00f6l\u00fcn\u00fcr.",
