    "Are you sure you want to delete this comment?": "Bu \u015f\u0259rhi silm\u0259k ist\u0259diyinizd\u0259n \u0259minsinizmi?",
    "Are you sure you want to delete this post?": "Bu postu silm\u0259k ist\u0259diyinizd\u0259n \u0259minsinizmi?",
