    "Are you sure you want to delete {email} from the course team for \u201c{container}\u201d?": "Siz {email} kurs komandas\u0131nda \u201c{container}\u201d \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn silm\u0259k ist\u0259yirsiniz?",
    "Are you sure you want to delete {email} from the library \u201c{container}\u201d?": "Siz {email} -i  \u201c{container}\u201d kitabxanas\u0131ndan silm\u0259y\u0259 \u0259minsiniz ?",
    "Are you sure you want to leave this page? \nTo pass your proctored exam you must also pass the online proctoring session review.": "Siz bu s\u0259hif\u0259d\u0259n \u00e7\u0131xmaq ist\u0259diyiniz\u0259 \u0259minsiniz? \nProktorlu imtahan\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 ke\u00e7m\u0259k \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn onlayn proktorinq sessiyas\u0131n\u0131n n\u0259z\u0259rd\u0259n ke\u00e7irilm\u0259sini d\u0259 ke\u00e7m\u0259lisiniz.",
    "Are you sure you want to remove this student's exam attempt?": "Bu t\u0259l\u0259b\u0259nin imtahan c\u0259hdini silm\u0259k ist\u0259diyiniz\u0259 \u0259minsinizmi?",
