    "Are you sure you want to remove this video from the list?": "Bu videonu siyah\u0131dan \u00e7\u0131xarmaq ist\u0259diyiniz\u0259 \u0259minsiniz?",
    "Are you sure you want to restrict {email} access to \u201c{container}\u201d?": "\u201c{container}\u201d \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn {email} \u00fcnvan\u0131na m\u0259hdudiyy\u0259t qoymaq ist\u0259yirsiniz?",
    "Are you sure you want to resume this student's exam attempt?": "Bu t\u0259l\u0259b\u0259nin imtahan c\u0259hdini davam etdirm\u0259k ist\u0259diyiniz\u0259 \u0259minsinizmi?",
    "Are you sure you want to revert to the last published version of the unit? You cannot undo this action.": "B\u00f6lm\u0259nin son d\u0259rc edilmi\u015f versiyas\u0131na qay\u0131tmas\u0131na ist\u0259diyinizd\u0259n \u0259minsiniz? Bu \u0259m\u0259liyy\u0259ti geri qaytarmaq m\u00fcmk\u00fcn deyil.",
    "Are you sure you want to select this session?": "Bu sessiyan\u0131 se\u00e7m\u0259k ist\u0259diyinizd\u0259n \u0259minsinizmi?",
    "Are you sure you want to unenroll from the purchased course {courseName} ({courseNumber})?": "Al\u0131nm\u0131\u015f kursdan {courseName} ({courseNumber}) \u00e7\u0131xmaq ist\u0259diyiniz\u0259 \u0259minsinizmi?",
    "Are you sure you want to unenroll from the verified {certNameLong}  track of {courseName}  ({courseNumber})?": "Siz t\u0259sdiq olunmu\u015f {certNameLong} {courseName} ({courseNumber}) kursunun siyahs\u0131ndan \u00e7\u0131xma\u011fa \u0259minsinizmi?",
    "Are you sure you want to unenroll from the verified {certNameLong} track of {courseName} ({courseNumber})?": "Siz t\u0259sdiq olunmu\u015f {certNameLong} {courseName} ({courseNumber}) kursunun siyah\u0131s\u0131ndan \u00e7\u0131xmaq ist\u0259yinizd\u0259n \u0259minsinizmi?",
    "Are you sure you want to unenroll from {courseName} ({courseNumber})?": "Siz {courseName} ({courseNumber}) siyah\u0131dan \u00e7\u0131xma\u011fa \u0259minsinizmi?",
    "Are you sure you want to unenroll from {courseName} ({courseNumber})? You will be refunded the amount you paid.": "{courseName} ({courseNumber}) kursundan \u00e7\u0131xmaq ist\u0259diyiniz\u0259 \u0259minsinizmi? \u00d6d\u0259diyiniz m\u0259bl\u0259\u011f siz\u0259 geri qaytar\u0131lacaq.",
    "Are you sure you wish to delete this item. It cannot be reversed!\n\nAlso any content that links/refers to this item will no longer work (e.g. broken images and/or links)": "Bu elementin silinm\u0259sind\u0259n \u0259minsiniz? \u018fm\u0259liyyat\u0131 sonradan t\u0259xir\u0259 salmaq m\u00fcmk\u00fcn deyil!\n\nBu element\u0259 istinad ed\u0259n h\u0259r hans\u0131 m\u0259zmun art\u0131q i\u015fl\u0259m\u0259y\u0259c\u0259k (misal \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn, i\u015fl\u0259m\u0259y\u0259n/g\u00f6rs\u0259nm\u0259y\u0259n \u015f\u0259kil v\u0259 ke\u00e7idl\u0259r)",
    "Are you sure?": "\u018fminsiniz?",
    "As part of the verification process, you take a photo of both your face and a government-issued photo ID. Our authorization service confirms your identity by comparing the photo you take with the photo on your ID.": "Do\u011frulama prosesinin bir hiss\u0259si olaraq, h\u0259m \u00fcz\u00fcn\u00fcz\u00fcn, h\u0259m d\u0259 d\u00f6vl\u0259t t\u0259r\u0259find\u0259n verilmi\u015f foto\u015f\u0259killi \u015f\u0259xsiyy\u0259t v\u0259siq\u0259nizin \u015f\u0259klini \u00e7\u0259kirsiniz. Avtorizasiya xidm\u0259timiz \u015f\u0259xsiyy\u0259tinizi \u00e7\u0259kdiyiniz \u015f\u0259kli \u015f\u0259xsiyy\u0259t v\u0259siq\u0259nizd\u0259ki \u015f\u0259kill\u0259 m\u00fcqayis\u0259 ed\u0259r\u0259k t\u0259sdiql\u0259yir.",
    "As part of the verification process, you take a photo of both your face and a photo ID. Our authorization service confirms your identity by comparing the photo you take with the photo on your ID.": "Do\u011frulama prosesinin bir hiss\u0259si olaraq, h\u0259m \u00fcz\u00fcn\u00fcz\u00fcn, h\u0259m d\u0259 \u015f\u0259xsiyy\u0259t v\u0259siq\u0259nizin \u015f\u0259klini \u00e7\u0259kirsiniz. Avtorizasiya xidm\u0259timiz \u00e7\u0259kdiyiniz \u015f\u0259kli \u015f\u0259xsiyy\u0259t v\u0259siq\u0259nizd\u0259ki \u015f\u0259kill\u0259 m\u00fcqayis\u0259 ed\u0259r\u0259k \u015f\u0259xsiyy\u0259tinizi t\u0259sdiql\u0259yir.",
    "As you complete courses, you will see them listed here.": "D\u0259rsl\u0259ri bitirdikc\u0259 onlar\u0131 burda siyah\u0131ya al\u0131nm\u0131\u015f g\u00f6r\u0259c\u0259ksiniz.",
