    "It is strongly recommended that you include four or fewer signatories. If you include additional signatories, preview the certificate in Print View to ensure the certificate will print correctly on one page.": "D\u00f6rd v\u0259 daha az imza sahibinin daxil edilm\u0259si m\u0259sl\u0259h\u0259t g\u00f6r\u00fcl\u00fcr. \u018flav\u0259 imza sahibl\u0259rini daxil ed\u0259rk\u0259n, sertifikat\u0131n bir s\u0259hif\u0259d\u0259 d\u00fczg\u00fcn \u00e7ap olunaca\u011f\u0131na \u0259min olmaq \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn \u00c7ap G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcd\u0259 \u00f6nbax\u0131\u015f edin.",
    "It is visible to learners, ensuring that all learners can view its contents.": "Bu, \u00f6yr\u0259n\u0259nl\u0259r \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u0259ndir v\u0259 b\u00fct\u00fcn \u00f6yr\u0259n\u0259nl\u0259rin onun m\u0259zmununu g\u00f6r\u0259 bilm\u0259sini t\u0259min edir.",
