    "Learners do not see the subsection in the course outline. The subsection is not included in grade calculations.": "T\u0259l\u0259b\u0259l\u0259r altb\u00f6lm\u0259ni d\u0259rs plan\u0131nda g\u00f6rm\u00fcrl\u0259r. Alt b\u00f6lm\u0259 qiym\u0259t hesablanmas\u0131nda istifad\u0259 olunmur.",
    "Learners do not see whether their answers to assessments were correct or incorrect, nor the score received, until after the due date for the subsection has passed.": "T\u0259l\u0259b\u0259l\u0259r tap\u015f\u0131r\u0131qlara verdikl\u0259ri cavablar\u0131n d\u00fczg\u00fcn olub olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 v\u0259 ald\u0131\u011f\u0131 qiym\u0259ti alt b\u00f6lm\u0259ni bitir\u0259n\u0259 g\u0259d\u0259r g\u00f6rm\u00fcrl\u0259r.",
    "Learners never see whether their answers to assessments are correct or incorrect, nor the score received.": "T\u0259hsil alanlar he\u00e7 vaxt qiym\u0259tl\u0259ndirm\u0259l\u0259r\u0259 verdikl\u0259ri cavablar\u0131n do\u011fru v\u0259 ya yanl\u0131\u015f oldu\u011funu, el\u0259c\u0259 d\u0259 ald\u0131qlar\u0131 bal\u0131 g\u00f6rm\u00fcrl\u0259r.",
