    "This image file type is not supported. Supported file types are {supportedFileFormats}.": "Bu \u015f\u0259kil fayl\u0131 d\u0259st\u0259kl\u0259nmir. D\u0259st\u0259kl\u0259n\u0259n fayl n\u00f6vl\u0259ri bunlard\u0131r: {supportedFileFormats}.",
