    "This may be happening because of an error with our server or your internet connection. Try refreshing the page or making sure you are online.": "Bu problem serverimizd\u0259 olan x\u0259ta v\u0259 ya sizin internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 il\u0259 \u0259laq\u0259dar ola bil\u0259r. Z\u0259hm\u0259t olmasa s\u0259hif\u0259ni yenil\u0259y\u0259r\u0259k onlayn ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n olmas\u0131na \u0259min olun.",
