    "This response could not be unendorsed. Refresh the page and try again.": "Bu cavab uy\u011fun olmad\u0131. S\u0259hif\u0259ni yenil\u0259yin v\u0259 yenid\u0259n c\u0259hd edin.",
    "This response could not be unmarked as an answer. Refresh the page and try again.": "Bu cavabland\u0131rma cavab olaraq siyah\u0131dan silinm\u0259di. S\u0259hif\u0259ni yenil\u0259yin v\u0259 yenid\u0259n c\u0259hd edin.",
    "This role requires a divided discussions scheme.": "Bu rol b\u00f6l\u00fcnm\u00fc\u015f m\u00fczakir\u0259 sxemi t\u0259l\u0259b edir.",
