    "We ask you to activate your account to ensure it is really you creating the account and to prevent fraud.": "F\u0131r\u0131ldaq\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n qar\u015f\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 almaq m\u0259qs\u0259dil\u0259 sizd\u0259n xahi\u015f edirik hesab\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 aktivl\u0259\u015fdir\u0259siz ki, hesab\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 h\u0259qiq\u0259t\u0259n sizin t\u0259r\u0259find\u0259 yarand\u0131\u011f\u0131na \u0259min olaq.",
    "We couldn't create your account.": "Hesab\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 a\u00e7a bilm\u0259dik.",
    "We couldn't find any results for \"%s\".": "\"%s\" \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn he\u00e7 bir n\u0259tic\u0259 tapa bilm\u0259dik.",
    "We couldn't sign you in.": "Sizi qeydiyyatdan ke\u00e7ir\u0259 bilm\u0259dik.",
    "We have encountered an error. Refresh your browser and then try again.": "X\u0259ta il\u0259 qar\u015f\u0131la\u015fd\u0131q. Brauzerinizi yenil\u0259yin v\u0259 sonra yenid\u0259n c\u0259hd edin.",
    "We have received your information and are verifying your identity. You will see a message on your dashboard when the verification process is complete (usually within 5-7 days). In the meantime, you can still access all available course content.": "Biz sizin m\u0259lumat\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 ald\u0131q v\u0259 \u015f\u0259xsiyy\u0259tinizi t\u0259sdiql\u0259yirik. Do\u011frulama prosesi ba\u015fa \u00e7atd\u0131qda (ad\u0259t\u0259n 5-7 g\u00fcn \u0259rzind\u0259), paneliniz\u0259 bir mesaj g\u00f6r\u0259c\u0259ksiniz. Bu arada, h\u0259l\u0259 m\u00f6vcud olan kurs m\u0259zmununa daxil ola bil\u0259rsiniz.",
    "We just need a little more information before you start learning with %(platformName)s.": "Siz \u00f6yr\u0259nm\u0259y\u0259 %(platformName)s ba\u015flamadan \u00f6nc\u0259 bizim bir ne\u00e7\u0259 m\u0259lumata ehtiyac\u0131m\u0131z var.",
    "We securely encrypt your photo and send it to our authorization service for review. Your photo and information are not saved or visible anywhere on %(platformName)s after the verification process is complete.": "Biz sizin foto\u015f\u0259klinizi \u015fifr\u0259l\u0259m\u0259k \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn \u0259n y\u00fcks\u0259k t\u0259hl\u00fck\u0259sizlik s\u0259viyy\u0259sind\u0259n istifad\u0259 edirik v\u0259 n\u0259z\u0259rd\u0259n ke\u00e7irm\u0259k \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn avtorizasiya xidm\u0259tin\u0259 g\u00f6nd\u0259ririk. Sizin foto\u015f\u0259kliniz v\u0259 m\u0259lumatlar\u0131n\u0131z yoxlama prosesi ba\u015fa \u00e7atd\u0131qdan sonra %(platformName)s -da yadda\u015fda saxlan\u0131lm\u0131r v\u0259 h\u0259r hans\u0131 bir yerind\u0259 g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcr.",
    "We use the highest levels of security available to encrypt your photo and send it to our authorization service for review. Your photo and information are not saved or visible anywhere on %(platformName)s after the verification process is complete.": "Biz sizin foto\u015f\u0259klinizi \u015fifr\u0259l\u0259m\u0259k \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn \u0259n y\u00fcks\u0259k t\u0259hl\u00fck\u0259sizlik s\u0259viyy\u0259sind\u0259n istifad\u0259 edirik v\u0259 n\u0259z\u0259rd\u0259n ke\u00e7irm\u0259k \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn avtorizasiya xidm\u0259tin\u0259 g\u00f6nd\u0259ririk. Sizin foto\u015f\u0259kliniz v\u0259 m\u0259lumatlar\u0131n\u0131z yoxlama prosesi ba\u015fa \u00e7atd\u0131qdan sonra %(platformName)s -da yadda\u015fda saxlan\u0131lm\u0131r v\u0259 h\u0259r hans\u0131 bir yerind\u0259 g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcr.",
    "We use your verification photos to confirm your identity and ensure the validity of your certificate.": "Biz \u015f\u0259xsiyy\u0259tinizi t\u0259sdiql\u0259m\u0259k v\u0259 sertifikat\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n etibarl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 t\u0259min etm\u0259k \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn yoxlama fotolar\u0131n\u0131zdan istifad\u0259 edirik.",
